      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Degenerative disk disease (DDD) is a common cause of low back pain and leg pain in children and infants. DDD is often unrecognized and under-diagnosed. This paper presents six cases of DDD in children and discusses the clinical presentation and pathophysiology of DDD."},
